Oratcl for Windows

This directory contains a prebuilt version of Oratcl for the windows
operating system.  It was compiled with stubs enabled, with Microsoft
visual studion 6.0, and with Tcl 8.3.2.

There are 2 files necessary for oratcl to operate on windows.

they are : oratcl42.dll pkgIndex.tcl

oratcl42.dll needs to be in your tcl\lib

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl42.dll

the tcl file needs to be in tcl\lib\oratcl4.2

	i.e. c:\program files\tcl\lib\oratcl4.2\pkgIndex.tcl
